data: {"call_id":"call_O2ri85tdvqm7Fw3eSh3JmII9","results":[{"id":1,"last_updated":"2026-10-04","snippet":"# Global inference. Local data.\n## Inference in-region, not routed cross-country\nFrost \u0026 Sullivan identified Telnyx as a leader and among a select group of providers sustaining innovation momentum through developer-centric tools, low-latency infrastructure, and enterprise-scale AI capabilities.\nDavid Casem, CEO at Telnyx","source":"web","title":"Telnyx Named a Leader in Frost \u0026 Sullivan's 2025 CPaaS ...","url":"https://telnyx.com/landing/telnyx-named-leader-cpaas-frost-radar"},{"date":"2026-10-17","id":2,"last_updated":"2026-10-07","snippet":"David Casem - Telnyx, CEO\n# David Casem\n### CEO, Telnyx","source":"web","title":"David Casem - Telnyx, CEO","url":"https://www.techtarget.com/contributor/David-Casem"},{"date":"2026-07-22","id":3,"last_updated":"2026-09-22","snippet":"# \"We're at an Inflection Point\": Telnyx CEO Says AI Infrastructure Is Becoming the Industry's Next Bottleneck\n\"Everyone is focused on building smarter agents.\nThat's the right problem to solve,\" said David Casem, CEO of Telnyx, a voice AI infrastructure platform.\n\"What we're not talking about is what happens when you go from running 1,000 agents to running 10 million of them simultaneously.\nThat's a fundamentally different engineering problem, and most of the industry isn't ready for it.\"\nThe concern is not theoretical.","source":"web","title":"\"We're at an Inflection Point\": Telnyx CEO Says AI Infrastructure Is Becoming the Industry's Next Bottleneck","url":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/special/contributor-content/2026/07/22/were-at-an-inflection-point-telnyx-ceo-says-ai-infrastructure-is-becoming-the-industrys-next-bottlen/91012736007/"},{"id":4,"last_updated":"2026-10-20","snippet":"**David Casem**\n**Co-founder \u0026 CEO**\n**CEO at Telnyx**\nUnited States\n8685 followers · 500+ connections\n### Experience\n- **Co-founder \u0026 CEO**\n**Telnyx**\nMay 2009 - Present\nChicago, IL\nTelnyx provides a cloud-based platform that offers access to carrier-grade services over the internet.\nWe are focused on enabling a communication fabric for developers and platforms to integrate voice, messaging and other forms of rich communication into their applications and to facilitate that communication universally.\n...\n### Education\n- **Illinois Mathematics and Science Academy**","source":"web","title":"David Casem | LinkedIn","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dcasem"},{"date":"2026-07-22","id":5,"last_updated":"2026-10-08","snippet":"# Telnyx CEO says the most important AI company of the next decade may not be a model company\nTelnyx CEO David Casem recently released a statement saying that the defining competitive advantage in enterprise AI belongs not to the companies building the smartest models, but to those building the infrastructure that decides where every AI request runs.\nDavid Casem, CEO of Telnyx, an AI infrastructure platform released the following statement:\n\u003e *“The future of AI is routing intelligence.\nThe companies that define the next phase of enterprise AI won’t necessarily be the ones that built the smartest model.\nThey’ll be the ones that built the intelligence to decide where every request should run.”*\nAnalysis of more than 2.4 billion AI API calls across 8,000 enterprises found that token costs fell 67% year over year.","source":"web","title":"Telnyx CEO says the most important AI company ...","url":"https://techcrunch.com/press-release/telnyx-ceo-says-the-most-important-ai-company-of-the-next-decade-may-not-be-a-model-company/"},{"date":"2026-09-23","id":6,"last_updated":"2026-10-05","snippet":"# Board of Directors\n## David Casem – Telnyx\nDavid Casem is Co-Founder and CEO of Telnyx, where he leads one of the most advanced global communications and AI infrastructure platforms in the market.\nSince founding Telnyx in 2009, David has built a full-stack platform that unifies carrier-grade communications, real-time connectivity, and AI-driven capabilities, giving businesses unprecedented control over how they build and scale conversational experiences.\nTelnyx’s ultra-low-latency architecture and developer-first tools power mission-critical communications for companies operating at global scale.","source":"web","title":"Board of Directors - SIP Forum","url":"https://www.sipforum.org/about/board-of-directors/"},{"date":"2026-07-31","id":7,"last_updated":"2026-08-03","snippet":"## Crypto Futures Trading Explained: ...\nTelnyx CEO David Casem took to LinkedIn, saying, “AI agents are becoming first-class economic actors.\nThey're opening accounts, provisioning resources, purchasing services, and increasingly participating directly in the economy.”","source":"web","title":"Telnyx CEO Says AI Agents Are “First-Class Economic Actors,” Now Buying Its Services","url":"https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/newsroom/telnyx-ceo-says-ai-agents-are-first-class-economic-actors-now-buying-its-services"},{"date":"2026-07-01","id":8,"last_updated":"2026-10-19","snippet":"## Telnyx Org Chart\nView Full Org Chart\nPaul Mataras\nPresident \u0026 Chief Executive Officer\nElle Marsh\n...\nPaul MatarasPresident \u0026 CEO\n...\n## CEO at Telnyx\nPaul Mataras\nPresident \u0026 Chief Executive ...## Leadership and Team\n- Paul Mataras\nPresident \u0026 Chief Executive Officer\n- Rohann Shekhawat\nChief Executive Officer\n- Jason Craft\nVice President, Platform\n- Tomasz Spychala\n...\n- Lauren Bergstrand","source":"web","title":"Telnyx - Overview, News \u0026 Similar companies | ZoomInfo.com","url":"https://www.zoominfo.com/c/telnyx-llc/358592976"},{"date":"2026-04-29","id":9,"last_updated":"2026-05-04","snippet":"# AI Missions, Agent Identity \u0026 the Future of Voice Infrastructure — with Telnyx CEO David Casem\nDavid Casem, co-founder \u0026 CEO of Telnyx, hopped in the car — and we went deep on what the next era of voice AI actually looks like from someone who's been in the trenches longer than most.","source":"web","title":"AI Missions, Agent Identity \u0026 the Future of Voice Infrastructure - Bluejay","url":"https://getbluejay.ai/blog/ai-missions-agent-identity-the-future-of-voice-infrastructure-%E2%80%94-with-telnyx-ceo-david-casem"},{"date":"2026-05-25","id":10,"last_updated":"2026-07-20","snippet":"# Telnyx\n## Telnyx Technology Stack\n### Frequently Asked Questions about Telnyx\nWho is the CEO of Telnyx?\nDavid Casem is the CEO of Telnyx.\nTo contact David Casem email at [email protected].\nOr you may call +13122857447, +1.3122708100, +1.3129457420, +1.3129457421 or +1.3129620438","source":"web","title":"Telnyx - Technology Stack - ContactOut","url":"https://contactout.com/company/telnyx-5494941/technology-stack"},{"id":11,"last_updated":"2026-10-02","snippet":"# Telnyx Takes on the Next Phase of Edge Computing\n## Telnyx is bringing compute, state and communications infrastructure closer together as AI agents become more persistent and real-time. The approach is designed to support applications that need to maintain context, communicate across channels and continue working over longer periods.\n“We’re moving from AI workflows to AI missions,” says David Casem, co-founder and CEO of Telnyx.\n“Not ‘did the agent handle the call?’\nbut ‘did the agent accomplish a multi-step task over hours or days … scheduling, follow-ups, payment collection, the whole thing.’”","source":"web","title":"Telnyx Takes on the Next Phase of Edge Computing By Investing.com Studios","url":"https://www.investing.com/studios/contributor-content/telnyx-takes-on-the-next-phase-of-edge-computing-383362"},{"id":12,"last_updated":"2026-07-13","snippet":"# Telnyx\nTelnyx was founded in 2009 by CEO David Casem and COO Ian Reither as a lifestyle consultancy, specializing in call center system installations.\n...\n**Q: Please tell us about company’s top executives and the work that they are doing in our industry.**\nDavid Casem, a self-taught engineer and entrepreneur, is the co-founder and CEO of Telnyx.\nDavid built Telnyx starting with only open-source software and a license from the FCC.\nToday, Telnyx continues to expand its product offerings and reach via the most direct intercontinental interconnections.\nDavid continues to craft Telnyx’s strategic vision and is a hands-on leader in every facet of the organization.\n...\nIan Reither is the co-founder and COO of Telnyx.","source":"web","title":"Internet Network Regulations \u0026 Telecom Policy Association","url":"https://membership.incompas.org/content.asp?contentid=635"},{"date":"2026-04-08","id":13,"last_updated":"2026-09-23","snippet":"In this CPTV interview, I spoke with Telnyx CEO David Casem about the advantages of running AI on a carrier-grade infrastructure and using one vendor for a full-stack voice AI solution.","source":"web","title":"CPTV: Telnyx CEO Casem Touts Voice AI Uptime Expertise","url":"https://channelpartnersconference.com/article/cptv-telnyx-ceo-casem-touts-voice-ai-uptime-expertise/"},{"date":"2023-01-01","id":14,"last_updated":"2026-10-20","snippet":"## Telnyx CEO\nPaul MatarasPresident \u0026 Chief Executive Officer\nPhoneEmail\nSee Profile\n...\nWho is the CEO of Telnyx?\nTelnyx’s CEO is Paul Mataras Who are Telnyx key employees?","source":"web","title":"Telnyx: Employee Directory | ZoomInfo.com","url":"https://www.zoominfo.com/pic/telnyx-llc/358592976"},{"id":15,"last_updated":"2025-11-03","snippet":"# Telnyx Management Team\n## 5 Team Members\nTelnyx has 5 executives.\nTelnyx's current Founder, Chief Executive Officer is David Casem.\n|Name|Work History|Title|Status|\n|--|--|--|--|\n|David Casem|Founder, Chief Executive Officer|Current|\n...\n|Name|David Casem|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|\n|--|--|--|--|--|--|\n|Work History|\n|Title|Founder, Chief Executive Officer|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|\n|Status|Current|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|Subscribe to see more|\n- Predict emerging trends\n- See competitors' playbooks","source":"web","title":"Telnyx Management Team","url":"https://www.cbinsights.com/company/telnyx/people"}],"sequence_number":7,"thought":"Found 15 results","type":"response.reasoning.search_results"}

